      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 10,
      "original_position": 5,
      "content": "好，按默认方案来：**Excel 报价单（询价单模式，单价留空给供应商填）+ 标准商务条款字段**。开始搭建。"
